pal caught it, 2026-08-10): the 'WYNN is rerouting-insured' framing is WRONG ON GEOGRAPHY — the 2021 rerouting precedent sent the displaced Asian premium wallet to SINGAPORE (MBS/LVS, record years) and MANILA, NOT Las Vegas; a wallet fleeing Chinese enforcement does not reroute INTO BSA/visa jurisdictions. Wynn's ex-Macau assets (LV/Boston/UAE-2027) serve a DIFFERENT wallet — partial insurance at best via the Vegas Asian-diaspora baccarat slice. Consequences the benches must adopt: (1) the rerouting-insured diversified expression is LVS, not WYNN; (2) WYNN-vs-1128 reduces to materiality dilution + the UAE option vs undiluted torque — no tail-insurance tiebreaker; (3) the tail hedge for a 1128 long = LVS or defined-risk structure, never long-WYNN-short-1128 (which shorts the recovery AND longs a different wallet). || HOLD-DECOMPOSITION AMENDMENT (principal, 2026-08-10): before treating hold-normalized figures as truth, split the hold move into luck / STRUCTURAL (side-bets, smart tables — persistent, don't strip; pull the operator's multi-year hold trend) / COMPOSITION (the premium exit mechanically raises blended hold — the industry-wide H1 elevation may be the missing premium volume's shadow). Cohort-simultaneous hold elevation cannot be luck at these sample sizes. Use LVS's premium-vs-base mass splits to discriminate. Prediction to encode in packs: wallet return -> hold mix-reverts DOWN on recovering drop; hold holding high on recovered drop = structural = upside beyond volume-only models."
