    "context": "FAST-TRACK — complete BEFORE the FY26 results print (~8/27-28, 6-K-verified webinar). Clinuvel: profitable peptide pharma (SCENESSE/afamelanotide, EPP, ~90% GM), fresh Nasdaq line CUVL (20FR12B eff ~7/17/26, near-zero coverage), EV ~$226M VERIFIED (~$374-393M mcap less ~$167M cash), ~10x ex-cash earnings. Diligence brief in desk/data/edge_classifications/CUV.AX.json (claims table + Mode-B). RED LEADS WITH: (1) dersimelagon (Mitsubishi Tanabe ORAL MC1R agonist, same disease) — TWO completed Ph3s, second completed April 2026, results PENDING and undated: the existential bear over ~100% of revenue, unnamed in the pitch AND in Clinuvel's own 20-F (disclosure-hunt the omission); (2) CUV105 registry-vs-guide slip (registered PCD Dec-2025, guided topline Dec-2026 — RZLT class); (3) vitiligo TAM constrained by adjunct-to-phototherapy design vs at-home Opzelura; (4) Wolgen governance/cash-pile history. BLUE: verified profitability, honest ex-cash cheapness, two dated catalysts, uncovered US line. Liquidity: position via CUV.AX (~A$950k/day); CUVL line untradeable (~$22k/day). If ownable: freeze a Dec-topline catalyst probability BEFORE any entry (catalyst-prediction doctrine); attention screen CLEAN (score-1 post, no wave). || PRINCIPAL STEELMAN (8/25, binding on both benches): an implant isn't inherently inferior to a pill — LARC vs oral contraception is the precedent (adherence, typical-use efficacy, set-and-forget). RED must therefore specify the bear PRECISELY: not modality preference but (a) ACCESS/distribution — SCENESSE's accredited-center-only model vs any-prescriber oral; (b) pediatrics (dersimelagon trials included adolescents, US SCENESSE adult-only); (c) all CONDITIONAL on the pending Ph3 data — an underwhelming oral readout flips the thesis bullish outright. BLUE gets: LARC precedent, orphan-incumbent stickiness (decade of real-world safety, EU reimbursement, patient loyalty), market-EXPANSION two-sidedness (oral may grow the treated population while the base holds), and EPP's feedback-loop adherence nuance. The court's product should include a conditional tree on the dersimelagon readout, not a single-branch verdict."
